  "annotations_dropped": [
    {
      "annotation_id": "80de2dfd84394f36b2fa19a2253aec5f_9",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "2. On 11th December, 2023, this Court was persuaded to grant interim bail to the applicant as it was then submitted ABA-3270-2023@.DOC on behalf of the applicant that the co-accused were granted pre-arrest bail by an order dated 30th Decemb"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "85d5bca342bf47a99338e24713f0eb98_73",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "16. In my considered view, it would not be appropriate to determine the entitlement of the applicant for pre-arrest bail on the basis of the aforesaid observations in the order dated 30th October, 2021."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "52ccb3d754f44e4db6f8e8d9eac64263_74",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nInstead, the role attributed to the applicant in the FIR deserves to be carefully examined."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9ff6ed73245e41cb81d3161042a86f17_75",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nABA-3270-2023@.DOC"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "37f8c7ccd9f9445ea91a464e686ca0bf_76",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Primarily the allegations of dishonestly transmitting the data of Schade Steel were made against Manojkumar Mohite (A1)."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a977cb394c0d473c97c597799fea82db_77",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Manojkumar Mohite (A1) had allegedly shared the said data with applicant, Sorn Schade (A2), Anand Deshpande (A5) and Nilesh Patel (A4)."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "700bab24616644a2995125d7fda6965b_78",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Prima facie, it would be difficult to draw a qualitative distinction between the role of the applicant and the co-accused, who have been granted pre-arrest bail, as all of them were allegedly recipients of the data dishonestly transmitted b"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "977104dbdc674857b47f37ec1a3522bb_79",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "17. The genesis of the offences also deserves to be kept in view."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2de09e47d2e94eaa9da64720cc21a08f_80",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The dispute amongst the members of the Schade family based in Germany is the genesis of the alleged offences."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "99d93d8f5eba4efebc20ce61972e4231_81",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Allegations of data theft are required to be viewed through this prism."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "70e4fe2e0e724d529cc33b714308be02_82",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nArtur Schade Steel Products India Pvt ... vs State Of Maharashtra on 1 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/159340445/"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8e4cb0aa92164fb293fdfc4ea145c204_83",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n4 18. Mr. Nevagi invited the attention of the Court to a purported Minutes of Meeting of the Joint Venture between the applicant and Sorn Schade (A2), wherein there is a reference to the proposed planned hostile take over of Schade Steel."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "141d557b3afe45dbaa9cf5084261f4eb_84",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It was urged that the applicant was privy to the conspiracy to take over Schade Steel and transmission of data with a view to cause wrongful loss to Schade Steel."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "238fe2a7e3ac4de19fda60bef9a9f3ce_85",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The mere fact that the applicant joined hands with Sorn Schade ABA-3270-2023@.DOC after there was a dispute among the members of the Schade family, by itself, is not sufficient to draw an inference of criminality."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7912606bce624eb99fcc815850c46b37_86",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Whether there was an attempt to take over Schade Steel by unlawful means and was there an element of criminality in the said endeavour, would be matters for adjudication."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cc6b97a8e34340afb23aab497bfb942c_87",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "19. Prima facie, the implication of the applicant for the offence punishable under section 408 appears contestable, as the applicant cannot be said to be entrusted with data since the applicant had parted ways with Schade Steel much before "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ae36ba4831c043be96af325b3fded0e4_88",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In a situation of this nature, whether there are elements of deceit coupled with injury so as to constitute an offence of cheating punishable under Section 420 of the Penal Code, qua the applicant also appears debatable."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e38c9d9c53ea43c69374c668a959e267_89",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "At any rate, the offences under Sections 408 and 420 entail punishment which may extend to seven years imprisonment."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e784dd220c17437e978ec13b961f1b71_90",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "20. In any event, having regard to the role attributed to the applicant, at this length of time, the custodial interrogation of the applicant does not seem warranted to facilitate effective investigation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0ec79f72096447d9a9a4d75e93115df9_91",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nYet to take care of the submission of the learned APP that the applicant has not co-operated with the ABA-3270-2023@.DOC investigation, as expected, I deem it appropriate to direct that the applicant shall appear before the Investigating O"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "80f19a6251e64c19ace7915b9dc5cabb_92",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "21. Hence the following order:\n:ORDER:"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bf8e5b7f295a4817aef58fe9571172e2_93",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(i) Application stands allowed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "03fa940e04db480bb4647430c0f6d78b_94",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(ii) Order of interim bail dated 11th December, 2023 is  made absolute on the terms and conditions  incorporated therein."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b9ffb715ae2c486995fc8c4305bfce42_95",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(iii) In addition, the applicant shall appear before the Investigating Officer on two consecutive days between 10.00 a.m. to 2.00 p.m. upon three weeks advance notice to be served by e-mail."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "de5b51e682ef4f3eba0e938428c8049f_96",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(iv) The applicant shall furnish his e-mail and phone number to the Investigating Officer within a week from the date of this order."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "333e106d7f11431cb19adee8045d5ef7_98",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n5 (v) In view of disposal of ABA/3270/2023, IA/4516/2023 also stands disposed."
    }
  ],
